NOTE ON THE ROBŌTARIIS UNIVERSE

The MIT license above covers the SOURCE CODE only.

It does not cover the Robōtariis fictional universe — the lore, characters,
factions, places, artefacts, terminology and narrative works. Those are
published separately under Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0:

    https://robotariis.com/licence

In short: derivative works are welcome (fan fiction, illustration, RPG
material), commercial use of the universe is not, and adaptations must share
alike. The code above has no such restriction.

The name "Robōtariis", the sigil and the visual identity are not under CC.
You may tell stories in this universe; you may not present yourself as its
publisher.

In plain terms: fork the code, study it, build on it, sell what you build with
it. But the world it was written for is not part of the deal.

